    "routeAndIdentity": "Alignment becomes ninth required independently collected artifact HTML byte identity. Embeddings remains explicit weaker HTTP/MIME/BUILD_ID control, zero scenes/toc/heavy marker assertions kept. Same fixed route lists required in runner/extractor/collector.",
