    "hashDAG": "Freeze source/tests -> old-only predecessor proof -> inventory containing new proof hash; record current manifest hash outside this hashed set. No proposed backward edge from proof to current manifest.",
    "primaryAssertions": "Existing foundations/inference/training/pretraining, known-site and path modules remain byte-identical. Preserve release identity, tar regular/unique/single-build, favicon no-exception, network/MIME/body/console/noJS classification, output-root, lockfile and browser contracts. Current code contains these assertions; proposed integration retains them.",
    "independentFixture": "Plan separates explicit reward from policy-derived reward, fixed response probabilities from full KL, same-x cancellation from invalid input, pair loss from dataset expectation, and fixed-beta algebra from trained update/quality. Risk/feedback require visible structure/text and unknowns, not scores invented from DOM.",
    "imageAndOriginalArticle": "Six profiles include low-height/DSF2. Viewport plus complete-scene image capture and independent actual-size review remain separate from DOM/geometry. Original nine H3/four equations/Mermaid and 390px DPO keyboard/formula checks stay active."
